WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:05.200
Your son is slow of wit and has not yet grasped Father's intent, nor do I dare presume to guess your imperial mind.

00:05.720 --> 00:10.960
That Yu Gong from the Imperial Academy who wrote the treasonous poem... do you know him?

00:12.200 --> 00:15.000
Rise and answer.
Thank you, Father.
